All six features are implemented and verified. Here's what changed:

**`app/auth.py`** — `require_api_key` now validates the `X-API-Key` header against `VALID_API_KEYS`, raising 401 on missing or invalid keys, and returns the username on success.

**`app/main.py`** — four endpoint changes:

- **`GET /tasks`** — added optional query params `status`, `priority`, `assigned_to` (all combinable filters) and `page`/`page_size` (pagination, defaults 1 and 20). Filtering happens before slicing.
- **`POST /tasks`** — requires auth via `Depends(require_api_key)`, validates `project_id` exists (404 if not), auto-generates ID as `max(existing IDs) + 1`, returns 201.
- **`PUT /tasks/{task_id}`** — requires auth, applies partial updates via `TaskUpdate.model_dump(exclude_unset=True)`, returns 404 if task not found.
- **`DELETE /tasks/{task_id}`** — requires auth, returns 204 on success, 404 if task not found.
